[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18125.59, "timestamp": "05:02:05", "text": "我希望"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18127.99, "timestamp": "05:02:07", "text": "不是。我希望不是。我們贏了嗎？我們贏了。我們贏了，因為我還活著。 [音樂] 你騙了我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18131.75, "timestamp": "05:02:11", "text": "我知道。就像她花了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18141.19, "timestamp": "05:02:21", "text": "很多時間打掃房間一樣，兄弟。我知道那是謊言。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18143.91, "timestamp": "05:02:23", "text": "我告訴過"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18146.15, "timestamp": "05:02:26", "text": "你。把它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18157.43, "timestamp": "05:02:37", "text": "交給我吧，兄弟。我會幫你的。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18159.19, "timestamp": "05:02:39", "text": "我只知道鴿子捲的事。所以，夥計們，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18168.628, "timestamp": "05:02:48", "text": "我只是想報復那個想殺我的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18172.948, "timestamp": "05:02:52", "text": "。所以我問你，奧克西，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18174.628, "timestamp": "05:02:54", "text": "你是不是剛才那個該死的鴿子，"}]